		(uuid "28f87c2e-4742-4966-a231-0f1c969c57ed")
	)
	(text "Crank: 2-wire VR sensor (B10 +, B22 -) into M5. Knock (C25) into M13 (the STI has one knock sensor).\nCams: 3-wire Hall sensors (WI-114), wired straight to M1 inputs that have pull-ups; crossed parts = stronger pull-ups.\nAnalog sensors (MAF, MAP, IAT, ECT, TPS, pedal, TGV, fuel level) go straight to M1 inputs by net label.\nSensor returns C31/C34/C35 (GND_SENSOR): to GND through the fitted 0R, or to GNDA through the open link."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 15.24 22.86 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.8 1.8)
			)
			(justify left top)
		)
		(uuid "7f3d8a2a-7f06-424d-aaed-331dbca9b650")
	)
